{"version":1,"content":"<p>特首李家超今晚出席在亞太經合組織（APEC）財長會議歡迎晚宴，會上他向與會代表介紹北部都會區將成為香港新的經濟引擎。</p><p>他又以晚宴安排表演中式音樂、中國武術及本地菜式為例，展示香港一直是不同文化傳統交融、東西方文化結合的國際城市。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:20:19.211750+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T13:32:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T21:37:45.747901+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T14:17:43.987107+00:00","content_hash":"2f7e72dcc40bbf69fac62fc5504bdee284af9ad332ef97893b5badd192570d36","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}